1
00:00:22,800 --> 00:00:25,568
Please share your favourite story with me, Peter.

2
00:00:25,984 --> 00:00:30,112
Sure. Once a lion caught a mouse.

3
00:00:30,912 --> 00:00:32,512
The mouse was afraid.

4
00:00:33,168 --> 00:00:38,800
He said, “Please let me go! One day I will help you!”

5
00:00:39,312 --> 00:00:42,432
The lion laughed and let the mouse go.

6
00:00:43,344 --> 00:00:47,328
Later, a hunter caught the lion in a net.

7
00:00:48,096 --> 00:00:50,400
The mouse helped the lion then.

8
00:00:51,104 --> 00:00:54,512
He bit through the net and set the lion free!

9
00:00:55,088 --> 00:00:59,040
I like that story. Kindness is never wasted

